      "justification": "Covers the alternative branch. The guard captures the positive condition, the action represents continuing the workflow, and the converge node structurally rejoins the split flows."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n5"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Once the invoices are returned to the client, receive the completed ones."
